                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>453 complete responses on resilience, mental toughness, coping, burnout surveys<br>Resilience (RISC-10; Personality). (Connor & Davidson, 2003)<br>Mental toughness (MTQ-18; Personality). Sub-factors: challenge, commitment, control (emotion/life), and confidence (interpersonal/ability). (Dagnall et al., 2019)<br>Coping (CFQ-18; Psychological skills). Sub-factors: Problem-focused coping, Emotion-focused coping, Avoidance Coping. (Kowalski & Crocker, 2001)<br>Burnout (ABO-S-15; Outcome variable). Subfactors: Exhaustion, Sport Devaluation, Reduced Accomplishment. (Isoard-Gautheur et al., 2018)</p>"
                }
